@startuml
actor Cliente as Frontend
participant "Servidor\nAutenticação" as AuthServer
participant "Rotas\nProtegidas" as ProtectedRoutes

Frontend -> AuthServer: POST /login\n(credenciais)
AuthServer --> Frontend: access_token\nrefresh_token

Frontend -> ProtectedRoutes: Requisição\nAuthorization: Bearer {access_token}
ProtectedRoutes --> Frontend: Resposta JSON

note over Frontend: Token expira (15 dias)

Frontend -> AuthServer: POST /refresh\n(refresh_token)
AuthServer --> Frontend: novo access_token\nnovo refresh_token
@enduml